        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evelyn`s game is a psychological horror game focused on atmosphere, storytelling, and emotional depth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Evelyn, a young woman returning to her childhood home after the death of her estranged mother. The house stands abandoned — but not empty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925410/extras/959b8203725a9dcc51fd44aedf837356.avif?t=1758559605\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Memories linger in every room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whispers echo through locked doors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something is watching.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And something still waits beneath.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925410/extras/720a5536a4bad7a8c4068d09be5e1551.poster.avif?t=1758559605\" width=730 height=410 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925410/extras/720a5536a4bad7a8c4068d09be5e1551.webm?t=1758559605\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925410/extras/720a5536a4bad7a8c4068d09be5e1551.mp4?t=1758559605\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a decaying family home filled with environmental storytelling, mysterious puzzles, and symbolic imagery. Use subtle clues to uncover the truth about Evelyn’s past — and a long-buried secret tied to a name she tried to forget.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you unlock the doors you sealed long ago?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925410/extras/b380b6aa46be641b475e75503b841b52.avif?t=1758559605\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A narrative-driven experience with no combat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep emotional story about guilt, memory, and forgiveness</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive atmosphere built through sound, lighting, and visuals</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925410/extras/b436ed0e3d50d89cb65e7bd2f9581b42.poster.avif?t=1758559605\" width=730 height=410 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925410/extras/b436ed0e3d50d89cb65e7bd2f9581b42.webm?t=1758559605\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925410/extras/b436ed0e3d50d89cb65e7bd2f9581b42.mp4?t=1758559605\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evelyn`s game is a psychological horror game focused on atmosphere, storytelling, and emotional depth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Evelyn, a young woman returning to her childhood home after the death of her estranged mother. The house stands abandoned — but not empty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925410/extras/959b8203725a9dcc51fd44aedf837356.avif?t=1758559605\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Memories linger in every room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whispers echo through locked doors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something is watching.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And something still waits beneath.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925410/extras/720a5536a4bad7a8c4068d09be5e1551.poster.avif?t=1758559605\" width=730 height=410 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925410/extras/720a5536a4bad7a8c4068d09be5e1551.webm?t=1758559605\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925410/extras/720a5536a4bad7a8c4068d09be5e1551.mp4?t=1758559605\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a decaying family home filled with environmental storytelling, mysterious puzzles, and symbolic imagery. Use subtle clues to uncover the truth about Evelyn’s past — and a long-buried secret tied to a name she tried to forget.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you unlock the doors you sealed long ago?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925410/extras/b380b6aa46be641b475e75503b841b52.avif?t=1758559605\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A narrative-driven experience with no combat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep emotional story about guilt, memory, and forgiveness</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive atmosphere built through sound, lighting, and visuals</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925410/extras/b436ed0e3d50d89cb65e7bd2f9581b42.poster.avif?t=1758559605\" width=730 height=410 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925410/extras/b436ed0e3d50d89cb65e7bd2f9581b42.webm?t=1758559605\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925410/extras/b436ed0e3d50d89cb65e7bd2f9581b42.mp4?t=1758559605\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
